---
title: Figure 3.9 — Diagramme d'activité — Processus global mission
---
flowchart TD
    Start([Début]) --> Create[Client crée mission<br/>formulaire adaptatif]
    Create --> Pay{Paiement MM OK?}
    Pay -->|Non| Cancel1[Annulation / pending]
    Pay -->|Oui| Funded[Funded — publiée]
    Funded --> Assign{Candidature ou<br/>sollicitation?}
    Assign --> Accept[Accepted + délai caution 4h]
    Accept --> Deposit{Caution payée?}
    Deposit -->|Non sous 4h| Back[Retour funded]
    Back --> Assign
    Deposit -->|Oui| AutoStart[Auto-start in_progress]
    AutoStart --> Exec[GPS + chat + preuves]
    Exec --> Submit[Submitted]
    Submit --> Wait{Client valide<br/>sous 48h?}
    Wait -->|Oui| Complete[Completed — 95/5]
    Wait -->|Non| AutoVal[Auto-validation Celery]
    AutoVal --> Complete
    Submit --> Dispute{Litige?}
    Dispute -->|Oui| Arb[Arbitrage admin]
    Arb --> Complete
    Arb --> Refund[Cancelled / remboursement]
    Complete --> Retain[Conservation 30 jours]
    Retain --> Purge[Purge si pas de litige ouvert]
    Purge --> End([Fin])
    Refund --> End
    Cancel1 --> End
